Show RLE environment details.

The command resolves the environment from the Foundry project and includes its
full version history. With no environment name, it uses the name saved in
.azd-rle.json.

Usage
  azd ai rle show [environment-name] [flags]

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for show
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (supported: default, json) (default "default")

Examples
  Show the locally saved environment and its version history
    azd ai rle show

  Inspect an existing environment by name
    azd ai rle show my-environment
